<title>UK: Westfalische Hypo ups step-up bond to 250 mln DEM.</title>
<headline>Westfalische Hypo ups step-up bond to 250 mln DEM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier today has been increased to 250 million marks from 165 million marks lead manager Chase Manhattan said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.125     MATURITY    20.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 20.AUG.02 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		 7.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
